cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Guardana
message: >-
  If you use Guardana in published work or in a security assessment, please cite
  the release you actually ran.
type: software
authors:
  - name: Guardana contributors
    email: contact@guardana.dev
repository-code: https://github.com/guardana/guardana
url: https://guardana.dev
abstract: >-
  Guardana verifies AI systems against a rule engine that behaves the same on a
  laptop, in CI and against a deployment: it scans model and application
  artifacts, probes live endpoints, MCP servers and agents, grades recorded
  executions, and compares runs for regressions. Every rule maps to a published
  framework edition, and a check that could not run is reported as inconclusive
  rather than as a pass.
keywords:
  - AI security
  - LLM security
  - prompt injection
  - agent security
  - Model Context Protocol
  - supply chain security
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.26.0
date-released: '2026-09-20'
